Package: ArchetypeShift
Type: Package
Title: Archetype Analysis and Biological Annotation for Single-Cell RNA-Seq
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Adam", "Wilson", email = "adam-wilson@ou.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R package for fitting, annotating, and comparing transcriptional archetype programs in single-cell RNA-seq data. ArchetypeShift supports Seurat-based preprocessing, ParetoTI/PCHA model fitting, correlation-based archetype signatures, replicate-aware occupancy analyses, and biological interpretation using pathway enrichment and cluster/state localization.
